> Witness: L1 331 (beeper48, c1, controls, gameover, spotL3Z7-51, L1Z1-L1Z6, L2Z1-L2Z7, L3Z1-L3Z12, L4Z1-L4Z9, level1-level4, spotL1Z4-43).

